Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?nemesis:=20round-13=20=E2=80=94=20accounts=20+?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20billing=20structure,=20distribution=20config?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- nemesis-account.ts: PharmaOrb Supabase auth (password sign-in, token refresh,
  persisted session), plan read straight from the subscriptions table with the
  user's own JWT (RLS auth.uid()=user_id — no backend changes, anon key is the
  same public value the web bundle ships)
- NemesisAccountGate: full-screen sign-in on launch (student build) with
  create-account link (web signup) + temporary owner 'Skip for now' bypass;
  Account dialog (plan badge, renewal, Upgrade/Manage billing → web app's
  Stripe page, Refresh plan, Sign out)
- Statusbar account chip: email · Plan (left side), opens the dialog
- electron-builder: category → education, generic update-feed config
  (updates.pharmaorb.app/nemesis, dormant until signed builds)
- DMG artifact builds: Nemesis-0.17.0-mac-arm64.dmg (unsigned; notarize.mjs
  hook activates when APPLE_API_* env vars exist)
